{"suttaId":"snp5.7","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Sn","vriCode":"s0505m.mul","paras":[3667,3697],"vripara":"1075"},"segments":{"snp5.7:0.2":"Upasīvamāṇavapucchā","snp5.7:1.1":"“Eko ahaṃ sakka mahantamoghaṃ,","snp5.7:1.2":"(iccāyasmā upasīvo)","snp5.7:1.3":"Anissito no visahāmi tārituṃ;","snp5.7:1.4":"Ārammaṇaṃ brūhi samantacakkhu,","snp5.7:1.5":"yaṃ nissito oghamimaṃ tareyyaṃ”. 1076.","snp5.7:2.1":"“Ākiñcaññaṃ pekkhamāno satimā,","snp5.7:2.2":"(upasīvāti bhagavā)","snp5.7:2.3":"Natthīti nissāya tarassu oghaṃ;","snp5.7:2.4":"Kāme pahāya virato kathāhi,","snp5.7:2.5":"taṇhakkhayaṃ nattamahābhipassa” [rattamahābhipassa (syā.), rattamahaṃ vipassa (ka.)]. 1077.","snp5.7:3.1":"“Sabbesu kāmesu yo vītarāgo,","snp5.7:3.2":"(iccāyasmā upasīvo)","snp5.7:3.3":"Ākiñcaññaṃ nissito hitvā maññaṃ;","snp5.7:3.4":"Saññāvimokkhe parame vimutto [dhimutto (ka.)],","snp5.7:3.5":"tiṭṭhe nu so tattha anānuyāyī” [anānuvāyī (syā. ka.)]. 1078.","snp5.7:4.1":"“Sabbesu kāmesu yo vītarāgo,","snp5.7:4.2":"(upasīvāti bhagavā)","snp5.7:4.3":"Ākiñcaññaṃ nissito hitvā maññaṃ;","snp5.7:4.4":"Saññāvimokkhe parame vimutto,","snp5.7:4.5":"tiṭṭheyya so tattha anānuyāyī”. 1079.","snp5.7:5.1":"“Tiṭṭhe ce so tattha anānuyāyī,","snp5.7:5.2":"pūgampi vassānaṃ samantacakkhu;","snp5.7:5.3":"Tattheva so sītisiyā vimutto,","snp5.7:5.4":"cavetha viññāṇaṃ tathāvidhassa”. 1080.","snp5.7:6.1":"“Accī yathā vātavegena khittā [khittaṃ (syā.), khitto (pī.)],","snp5.7:6.2":"(upasīvāti bhagavā)","snp5.7:6.3":"Atthaṃ paleti na upeti saṅkhaṃ;","snp5.7:6.4":"Evaṃ munī nāmakāyā vimutto,","snp5.7:6.5":"atthaṃ paleti na upeti saṅkhaṃ”. 1081.","snp5.7:7.1":"“Atthaṅgato so uda vā so natthi,","snp5.7:7.2":"udāhu ve sassatiyā arogo;","snp5.7:7.3":"Taṃ me munī sādhu viyākarohi,","snp5.7:7.4":"tathā hi te vidito esa dhammo”. 1082.","snp5.7:8.1":"“Atthaṅgatassa na pamāṇamatthi,","snp5.7:8.2":"(upasīvāti bhagavā)","snp5.7:8.3":"Yena naṃ vajjuṃ taṃ tassa natthi;","snp5.7:8.4":"Sabbesu dhammesu samūhatesu,","snp5.7:8.5":"samūhatā vādapathāpi sabbe”ti.","snp5.7:8.6":"Upasīvamāṇavapucchā chaṭṭhī niṭṭhitā. 7."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Pj-ii","bookName":"Suttanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0505a.att","from":2574,"to":2575,"paras":[{"para":2574,"vripara":"1077","refs":["snp5.7:3"],"lines":["Idāni yasmā so brāhmaṇo ākiñcaññāyatanalābhī tañca santampi nissayaṃ na jānāti, tenassa bhagavā tañca nissayaṃ uttari ca niyyānapathaṃ dassento <b>“ākiñcañña”</b>nti gāthamāha.","Tattha <b>pekkhamāno</b>ti taṃ ākiñcaññāyatanasamāpattiṃ sato samāpajjitvā vuṭṭhahitvā ca aniccādivasena passamāno.","<b>Natthīti nissāyā</b>ti taṃ “natthi kiñcī”ti pavattasamāpattiṃ ārammaṇaṃ katvā.","<b>Tarassu ogha</b>nti tato pabhuti pavattāya vipassanāya yathānurūpaṃ catubbidhampi oghaṃ tarassu.","<b>Kathāhī</b>ti kathaṃkathāhi.","<b>Taṇhakkhayaṃ nattamahābhipassā</b>ti rattindivaṃ nibbānaṃ vibhūtaṃ katvā passa.","Etenassa diṭṭhadhammasukhavihāraṃ katheti. 1078-9."],"lineRefs":[["snp5.7:3"],["snp5.7:3"],["snp5.7:3"],["snp5.7:3"],["snp5.7:3"],["snp5.7:3"],["snp5.7:3"]]},{"para":2575,"vripara":"1078-1079","refs":["snp5.7:4"],"lines":["Idāni “kāme pahāyā”ti sutvā vikkhambhanavasena attanā pahīne kāme sampassamāno <b>“sabbesū”</b>ti gāthamāha.","Tattha <b>hitvā mañña</b>nti aññaṃ tato heṭṭhā chabbidhampi samāpattiṃ hitvā.","<b>Saññāvimokkhe parame</b>ti sattasu saññāvimokkhesu uttame ākiñcaññāyatane.","<b>Tiṭṭhe nu</b> <b>so tattha anānuyāyī</b>ti so puggalo tattha ākiñcaññāyatanabrahmaloke avigacchamāno tiṭṭheyya nūti pucchati.","Athassa bhagavā saṭṭhikappasahassamattaṃyeva ṭhānaṃ anujānanto tatiyagāthamāha. 1080."],"lineRefs":[["snp5.7:4"],["snp5.7:4"],["snp5.7:4"],["snp5.7:4"],["snp5.7:4"]]}],"wordLinks":[["snp5.7:3.3","ākiñcaññaṃ",0,0],["snp5.7:4.1","sabbesū",1,0],["snp5.7:4.3","hitvā maññaṃ",1,1],["snp5.7:4.4","saññāvimokkhe parame",1,2]]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
